		"moveNote": "fly",
		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Animated flying scroll that smothers intruders. Often used as guardians of occult libraries and holy sites.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +1 (smother), <strong>MV</strong> close (fly), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flammable</strong>. Can be damaged by fire, takes double damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Object</strong>. When standing still, looks exactly like a scroll.</p><p></p><p><strong>Smother</strong>. Wrap around target's head. Cannot see or speak, suffocates in 2d4 rounds. Attacks against scroll split damage between scroll and victim.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
